          "id": 1984271,
          "date": "2026-12-04T02:30:00.000Z",
          "name": "Mo Mandel",
          "description": "<p><strong>About Mo:</strong></p><p>Straight off his appearance on <strong>Curb Your Enthusiasm</strong>, Mo is getting back on the road! Best known for his <strong>40 plus appearances on Chelsea Lately,</strong> and his hilarious <strong>hour special on Amazon.</strong></p><p> Mo has also made numerous appearances on<strong> Conan, The Late Late Show, has a half hour special on Comedy Central,</strong> and is a recurring guest on podcasts like, <strong>Adam Carolla, Bertcast, And the Fighter And The Kid.</strong> </p><p>In the past, Mo has also guest starred on such hit shows as <strong>Modern Family, Castle, Happy Endings, 2 Broke Girls, </strong>and was one of the leads of <strong>NBC\u2019S comedy Free Agents,</strong> opposite Hank Azaria and Kathryn Hahn. Mo also created and hosted a special for <strong>The Discovery Channel called Small Town Throwdown</strong>, and was the creator and executive producer of the <strong>hit series, Comedy Knockout, which aired on TruTv and HBO Max. </strong></p><p><strong>Item Requirement</strong><br />A minimum purchase of two menu items (food and/or beverage) per person is required in the showroom.</p><p><strong>Age Restrictions</strong></p><ul><li>Early Show: 16+</li><li>Late Show: 18+</li></ul><p><strong>Arrival Guidelines</strong></p><ul><li>To ensure optimal seating and timely food and beverage service, we recommend arriving early.</li><li>Doors open one hour prior to early shows and 30 minutes prior to late shows.</li><li>Third-party tickets will not be honored. Valid government-issued ID may be required, and the name on the ID must match the name on the ticket.</li></ul><p><strong>Preferred Seating</strong><br />Includes early entry, front-of-line access, and choice of available seating (excluding reserved group seating).</p><p><strong>Group Arrivals</strong><br />Groups of four (4) or more are encouraged to arrive at least 30 minutes before showtime to avoid potential seating separation.</p><p><strong>Fees</strong></p><ul><li>Applicable service fees and taxes will be added at checkout.</li><li>A 20% automatic gratuity will be applied to groups of six (6) or more in the showroom. Gratuity does not apply to ticket purchases.</li></ul><p><strong>Ticket Policies</strong></p><ul><li>All ticket sales are final and non-refundable.</li><li>Performer lineups are subject to change without notice.</li></ul>",
