          "description": "<p><strong>Special Presentation \u2013 No Passes/Coupons/Groupons Accepted</strong></p><p><strong>About Deric:</strong></p><p>Fresh off the release of his debut comedy special, Toxic Papa, Deric Cahill is back and bolder than ever with his new tour. This time, like Ebenezer himself, he's diving deep into the chaos of his past, the unhinged present, and whatever the hell the future might have for him. With his signature sharp wit, no topic is off-limits as he talks shit about everything that's shaped him\u2014from childhood drama to everyday struggles. Get ready for a raw and hilarious ride.</p><p><strong>Menu Requirement:</strong> Minimum of 2 menu items food or beverage per person in the showroom.</p><p><strong>Age Restrictions:</strong> Early Show: 16+ | Late Show: 18+</p><p><strong>Arrival Guidelines:</strong></p><ul><li>To ensure the best seating and prompt food and beverage service, we recommend arriving early.</li><li>Doors open 1 hour before the early shows and 30 minutes before the late shows.</li></ul><p><strong>Group Arrivals:</strong></p><ul><li>For groups of 4 or more, please arrive at least 30 minutes prior to showtime to avoid potential seating separation.</li></ul><p><strong>Fees:</strong></p><ul><li>Service fees and taxes will be applied at checkout.</li><li>Groups of 6 or more will incur a 20% automatic gratuity.</li></ul><p><strong>Ticket Policies:</strong></p><ul><li>Tickets are non-refundable after purchase.</li><li>Performers may change without prior notice.</li></ul><p><strong>Important Notice:</strong></p><ul><li>Beware of third-party ticket sales from other websites. <strong>House of Comedy \u2013 The Comic Strip </strong>is only responsible for tickets purchased directly from our official website. Proof of purchase or identification may be required to release tickets.</li></ul><p>com</p>",
